{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spinning Scarecrow</i></strong> is a top-down arcade puzzle game where every second counts, every obstacle is a threat, and movement itself is your worst enemy. In this disturbing hand-drawn world, you <strong>control a scarecrow</strong> that spins relentlessly, <strong>navigating claustrophobic mazes</strong> and <strong>dodging deadly traps</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level, the chaos intensifies: springs that reverse your rotation, life-saving power-ups (if timed right), and grotesque minigames that feel straight out of a twisted fairground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to grasp but hard to master</strong>: every mistake is a lesson, every perfection run a triumph. Designed for players who crave smart arcade challenges and unique visuals, Spinning Scarecrow mixes precise gameplay with a dark, grotesque aesthetic you won\u2019t forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <i>Kuru Kuru Kururin</i> had a creepy sibling inked in madness... <strong>this</strong> would be it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/extras/34c1c4581aad94cc5fb0fb05954af266.poster.avif?t=1770797326\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/extras/34c1c4581aad94cc5fb0fb05954af266.webm?t=1770797326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/extras/34c1c4581aad94cc5fb0fb05954af266.mp4?t=1770797326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Constantly spinning puzzle arcade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate hostile levels with a scarecrow that never stops rotating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Traps, springs and strategic reversals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study patterns, anticipate danger, and flip direction at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaa <strong>Grotesque minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From target crows to twisted timing tests: each challenge is unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f <strong>Hand-drawn intense art style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, stylized look with surreal dark comic vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Lethal mistakes, high rewards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited lives, perfectionist scoring, and addictive replay loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Versatile Game Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for short but intense sessions, perfect for speedrunners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267b\ufe0f <strong>High replay value</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat levels faster, better, and with higher scores every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/extras/6607b9628b691c22c7491fb4c8871cf6.poster.avif?t=1770797326\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/extras/6607b9628b691c22c7491fb4c8871cf6.webm?t=1770797326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/extras/6607b9628b691c22c7491fb4c8871cf6.mp4?t=1770797326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you can expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down spinning puzzle gameplay \u2014 think fast, spin faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional grotesque minigames for bonuses and chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups that rewrite the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local high score system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal but readable hand-drawn style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3409660?t=1770797326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/d7f9b6edd9b0dd09d894cb60d98f3901fcc53a9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770797326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/76c670abe0c2bbd4db0281c0cbf9bd4c53c5bde3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770797326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/76c670abe0c2bbd4db0281c0cbf9bd4c53c5bde3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770797326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4132340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Spinning Scarecrow</i></strong> is a top-down arcade puzzle game where every second counts, every obstacle is a threat, and movement itself is your worst enemy. In this disturbing hand-drawn world, you <strong>control a scarecrow</strong> that spins relentlessly, <strong>navigating claustrophobic mazes</strong> and <strong>dodging deadly traps</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level, the chaos intensifies: springs that reverse your rotation, life-saving power-ups (if timed right), and grotesque minigames that feel straight out of a twisted fairground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to grasp but hard to master</strong>: every mistake is a lesso